      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "滝の回廊で銃を向けられた時、\r\nどうしてアメリアが\r\n銃を撃たないってわかったんだ？",
        "official_en": "At Waterfall Way, when Amelia pointed her gun at you...why were you so sure she wouldn’t fire?",
